      <title>欧盟将ChatGPT列为超大型在线搜索引擎 监管要求大幅收紧</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260831/%E6%AC%A7%E7%9B%9F%E5%B0%86ChatGPT%E5%88%97%E4%B8%BA%E8%B6%85%E5%A4%A7%E5%9E%8B%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%E6%93%8E-%E7%9B%91%E7%AE%A1%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%A4%A7%E5%B9%85%E6%94%B6%E7%B4%A7/</link>
